resources","name":"砂山公園","category":"nature","address":"海岸景観 / 砂丘","source":"国土交通省 国土数値情報","municipality_code":"08232","municipality_pref":"茨城県","municipality_name":"神栖市","municipality_code_method":"nearest_centroid","resource_code":"811"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[140.69273376464844,35.89511489868164]}}],"display_comment_original":"神栖市には、地域の由緒を示す案内板や石碑を探す余地がある。 この地域には寺社や信仰の場、古墳や貝塚に関わる場所が見え、伊勢神社、息栖神社、出羽貝塚のような地点が探索の入口になる。 現地では石碑、地蔵、地域資料館、公民館の由緒板を、既存ピンと照らして歩くと発見しやすい。","story_enrichment":{"samurai_priority_people":[],"notable_people":["古谷三敏","神雷龍之助","柳川宗左衛門","山本懸蔵"],"honorary_citizens":[],"tourism_landmarks":["息栖神社","神善寺","長照寺","星福寺 ‐ 日本に養蚕を伝えたとされる「金色姫伝説」がある。","港公園","1000人画廊","波崎砂丘","シーサイドパーク"],"specialties":[],"food_culture":[],"historical_domains":[],"heian_place_names":[],"japan_search_support":[],"enrichment_sources":["https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%A5%9E%E6%A0%96%E5%B8%82","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q3776937","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q17361349","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q102246990","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q11469073"],"enrichment_errors":[],"wikipedia_title":"神栖市","wikipedia_revision_id":"110876719","wikidata_qid":"Q840595","wikipedia_url":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%A5%9E%E6%A0%96%E5%B8%82","japan_search_query_url":"","status":"wikipedia_ok"}}